  "name": "Junker",
  "description": "Heyyy, there you are. Back for more work, right? Yeah, I thought so, getting to know you, aren't I? Listen, I wanna give you a challenge. You know those shitty single shot rifles, the MP-18 or whatever? Go knock some heads with one. PMCs, no Scavs if you can help it. I may sell to PMCs, but the locals are my people, usually anyways. Take out ten of the fuckers.",
  "trader": "moron",
  "image": "5ae325c586f77444fa45d0de.jpg",
  "onSuccess": "Holy fuck, you actually wiped 10 dudes with one of those dumb shitty rifles? You deserve your reward man, here, take it. A few shirts too, hell they're the same brand as the gun. And some nice pants, too, why not. I'll see you next time homie.",
